    <briefdescription>
<para>Lightweight validator for .wasm binaries (no runtime required). </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Use this as a fast pre-check before constructing a full <ref refid="classthemis_1_1modules_1_1_wasm_plugin_sandbox" kindref="compound">WasmPluginSandbox</ref>, e.g. in a plugin registry that scans many files. </para>
